title: "ncert-skill-taxonomy"
abstract: >-
  An open prerequisite graph of mathematics skills for Indian Classes 1-8, derived from the
  Marble Skill Taxonomy and aligned to NCERT textbooks and NCF-SE 2023 competencies. AI-drafted; needs teacher review.
